  "description": "Subject: Item Entry \u2013 Flaming Sword (Custom Item Compendium\u202fp.\u202f42)\n\nThe Flaming Sword is a +1 magic weapon of the **uncommon** tier, listed in the *Custom Item Compendium* on page\u202f42. Its full title follows the naming conventions \u201cFlaming\u202f\u2026\u202fof the Phoenix,\u201d and it requires attunement (true). Designed as a **martial Longsword** (weapon\u202f=\u202ftrue, type\u202f=\u202fmartial, name\u202f=\u202fLongsword), the sword deals its normal damage plus an additional **fire damage** bonus and carries the **Light** property. While wielded, the bearer gains **fire resistance** and the weapon does not grant any stealth benefit. \n\nAll other variants are excluded from this entry; specifically, the item named \u201cCold Sword\u201d (see page\u202f10) is listed as an exclusion. The item is intended for normal display (noDisplay\u202f=\u202ffalse)."
